+{
+  "type": "feature",
+  "category": "``s3``",
+  "description": "Customize the S3 ``Expires`` shape. Responses whose ``Expires`` header cannot be parsed as a timestamp no longer fail; the ``Expires`` member is omitted and a warning is logged. The raw header value is returned in the new ``ExpiresString`` member, and ``Expires`` is deprecated in favor of it."
